<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: 等线 Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: 等线;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4472C4;  --docx-accent2-color: #ED7D31;  --docx-accent3-color: #A5A5A5;  --docx-accent4-color: #FFC000;  --docx-accent5-color: #5B9BD5;  --docx-accent6-color: #70AD47;  --docx-hlink-color: #0563C1;  --docx-folhlink-color: #954F72;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx p, p.docx_a {  text-align: justify;}.docx table, table.docx_a1 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_a3 {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}p.docx_a3 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}p.docx_a3 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_a4 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_a4 p {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}span.docx_a4 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}p.docx_a5 {  text-align: left;}p.docx_a5 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}p.docx_a5 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_a6 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_a6 p {  text-align: left;}span.docx_a6 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;">各位同学：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;按照学籍管理规定，根据《关于提前做好2025～2026学年第二学期补考工作的通知》，现开展2025～2026学年第二学期补（缓）考网上报名工作。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 16pt;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">网上报名时间为： 2026年2月25日9时～2026年3月2日24时。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 16pt;">学生可在网上进行补（缓）考预约报名，补（缓）考考场安排以网上预约名单为准，没有进行网上预约的同学视为自动放弃，不得参加补（缓）考；预约成功而未参加考试的同学成绩按零分计载。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">补考严格按照学籍管理规定，仅限有2025～2026学年第一学期期末不合格成绩的在籍在校学生才允许预约补考；缓考学生须预约补（缓）考。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;请各位同学注意报名截止时间，及时报名。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">附件:补考预约操作指南</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; margin-right: 42pt; text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">本科生院 &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; margin-right: 42pt; text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">2026年2月24日</span></p></article></section>
